                        <cell role="num">2</cell>
                        <cell role="num">2 (plus 1 RCT)</cell>
                    </row>
                </table>
                <p>The total civilian naval components throughout the period FY 1951–1952 are
                    estimated to approximate 923,000.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Approximate Navy &amp; Marine strength</hi> (end
                    figure)</p>
                <table cols="3" rows="5">
                    <row role="label">
                        <cell>Navy</cell>
                        <cell role="num">675,918</cell>
                        <cell role="num">725,000</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>Marine</cell>
                        <cell rendition="#border-bottom" role="num">166,155</cell>
                        <cell rendition="#border-bottom" role="num">162,000</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell rendition="#float-right">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Total</hi>
                        </cell>
                        <cell role="num">842,073</cell>
                        <cell role="num">887,000</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Approximate operating aircraft for above
                            figures</cell>
                        <cell role="num">5668</cell>
                        <cell role="num">6559</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell rendition="#hanging-indent">Approximate required numbers of aircraft
                            in the civilian components</cell>
                        <cell role="num">1844</cell>
                        <cell role="num">2001</cell>
                    </row>
